===Etymology 3===
Compare {{cog|lt|à}}, {{m|lt|õ}}, {{m|lt|oà||expression of pain, surprise}}, as well as {{cog|got|𐍉||ah!}}, {{cog|la|ā}}, {{m|la|āh||expression of pain, anger}}, {{cog|grc|ἆ||ah!}}

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|ru|аа|а́-а}}

